WHY

These files are compilations of facts: which issue holds which volume, on which
printed page a scan leaf stands, where an article begins and ends, who the
volume index names as its author, which OCR misreading was corrected to what.
Declaring them free removes any doubt. A citation apparatus is of little use if
others cannot build on it.

WHICH FILES

  data/catalogue.json    the run 1872–1969 as held by the Internet Archive
  data/manifest.json     the volumes built with full text
  data/vol/*.json        pagination, article delimitation, authors, volume
                         index, and the editorial repairs of the OCR
  docs/qa/*.md           the QA reports listing every repair and override

Attribution is not required, and is appreciated.

